abstract: "Educational research project evaluating whether small deep-learning architectures (LSTM, GRU, temporal 1D-CNN, tiny Transformer encoder) improve next-day S&P 500 ETF direction forecasting over simple baselines, under strict walk-forward evaluation with embargo, train-only scaling, a no-signal leakage control and cost-adjusted strategy evaluation."
